## Overview

- **Stack:** TypeScript, Next.js
- **Language:** typescript

## Commands

Run inside \`apps/web\`. Keep the \`rtk\` prefix.

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| install | \`rtk proxy pnpm install\` |
| dev | \`rtk proxy pnpm run dev\` |
| build | \`rtk err pnpm run build\` |
| test | \`rtk test pnpm run test\` |
| typecheck | \`rtk err pnpm exec tsc --noEmit\` |
